+  'syntax (Module|Stmt|Stmts|Expr|Val|KItem)|#loadAll|FuncDef\\(|Return\\(|Name\\(|Int\\(|BinOp\\(|Call\\(|#callee|#evalArgs|#applyK\\(toCall\\(closureVal|#bindP|#pop|applyBin\\(\"(\\+|\\*|//)\"|pyMod' \
